# Keep projects' high-level state and evidence manifest in git, not binary evidence.

# Exelia Full Installer v2 — machine-specific local traces, never commit
.exelia-install/

# Private, PROJECT-LOCAL installer dependencies; never commit tool binaries
.exelia-tools/

# Exelia 2.1 machine-local worktrees, generated prompts, browser traces and telemetry
.exelia/
# Local browser runtime/cache always stays in the repository, never under ~/.cache

# Downloaded third-party skills are reinstalled per clone, not redistributed by this template.
# Bundled original Exelia skills remain tracked; verify upstream rights before vendoring others.
/.agents/skills/frontend-design/
